  "lateFee": "Nebraska has no late-renewal fee as such; a missed deadline means the license is expired and must be reinstated. Reinstatement adds a $35 reinstatement fee on top of the $121 renewal fee ($156 total per the fee chart on the 01/2026 reinstatement application, prorated to $65.25 if reinstating April through August of an even-numbered year). Separately, practicing on an expired license incurs an administrative penalty of $10 per day up to $1,000.",
