  "lateFee": "MD: $100 if renewing after June 30 but by August 15; $200 if renewing August 16 through October 1 (16.10.9.8(F),(G) NMAC; windows mirror NMSA 61-6-26(D),(E)). DO under the still-current osteopathic rule: $200 for renewal July 2 through September 29, $400 after September 29 (16.17.2.8(C) NMAC).",
