  "fee": "$405.00 online renewal for a two-year license (board renewal page, effective August 1, 2023). Underlying rule sets licensure at $200 per year (N.D. Admin. Code 50-02-07.1-01); the extra $5 appears to be an online processing charge, which the board does not itemize.",
