  "fee": "$756 total for an Active MD/DO two-year renewal per the board fee schedule effective 7/2/2026: $608 license registration + $20 OHSU library + $50 HPSP fee + $70 prescription monitoring + $8 OHA workforce database. Inactive or Administrative Medicine status totals $686 (no PDMP fee). Active-One Year (postgraduate) is $378/year; Emeritus $114/year. Underlying rule: registration is $314/year including $10/year OHSU library (OAR 847-005-0005), rising to $375/year on or after March 1, 2028. All fees are nonrefundable, nontransferable, and cannot be prorated.",
